WEBVTT

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.100 --> 00:22.150
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

02:47.010 --> 02:53.980
<b>The Shrine of Trees
Into Which The Light Beckons</b>

02:52.690 --> 02:54.420
<b>Let’s play...</b>

04:46.000 --> 04:46.530
<b>Hey.</b>

04:46.540 --> 04:48.570
<b>All right! I win!</b>

04:48.570 --> 04:49.440
<b>What?</b>

04:49.440 --> 04:53.010
<b>I managed to keep my legs up 
until you came, so I win.</b>

04:53.010 --> 04:55.480
<b>Who were you having a match with?</b>

04:55.480 --> 04:58.450
<b>Afraid I don’t know that much.</b>

04:58.450 --> 04:59.950
<b>So, what’s up?</b>

05:00.520 --> 05:03.550
<b>It’s not like you to call me saying you
want to talk about something.</b>

05:03.550 --> 05:04.450
<b>Umm...</b>

05:04.450 --> 05:05.390
<b>Yeah?</b>

05:05.390 --> 05:07.190
<b>What do you think of Aizawa?</b>

05:07.190 --> 05:08.920
<b>What do I... think of him?</b>

05:08.920 --> 05:12.390
<b>I wonder why he lied to Sukawara like that...</b>

05:12.390 --> 05:15.430
<b>He should’ve seen her with me the other
day, but he said he didn’t see a thing...</b>

05:15.430 --> 05:18.830
<b>Maybe he just didn’t want to get involved?</b>

05:18.830 --> 05:21.240
<b>And hey, why don’t you try asking <i>him</i>?</b>

05:21.240 --> 05:23.900
<b>I dunno, it’s kind of hard to talk to him... to Mr. “I.”</b>

05:24.470 --> 05:27.270
<b>You’ll need to do something about that first.</b>

05:27.280 --> 05:29.110
<b>Just call him normally by his first name.</b>

05:29.110 --> 05:31.950
<b>Ah, that... I’d be too embarrassed.</b>

05:31.950 --> 05:33.510
<b>I just don’t get you at times.</b>

05:37.050 --> 05:38.720
<b>Me neither...</b>

05:38.720 --> 05:40.920
<b>But anyway, Miyama, to change the subject...</b>

05:40.920 --> 05:42.920
<b>How are things going with you and Kaburaki Takuma?</b>

05:45.290 --> 05:47.660
<b>Takkun’s going out with Unno, isn’t he?</b>

05:47.660 --> 05:49.660
<b>I just can’t accept that.</b>

05:50.300 --> 05:54.070
<b>I could’ve sworn you were really his favorite.</b>

05:54.070 --> 05:55.840
<b>No way.</b>

05:55.840 --> 05:57.300
<b>I dunno.</b>

05:57.840 --> 05:59.570
<b>But man, back when we were going here...</b>

05:59.570 --> 06:02.910
<b>...everything was always so much
more simple and straightforward.</b>

06:05.180 --> 06:06.380
<b>Not really...</b>

06:07.080 --> 06:08.420
<b>Did you just say something?</b>

06:09.280 --> 06:10.680
<b>Nothing!</b>

06:10.690 --> 06:11.620
<b>See you.</b>

06:19.760 --> 06:20.760
<b>Hey!</b>

06:21.400 --> 06:22.430
<b>A-Ah, umm...</b>

06:29.470 --> 06:30.540
<b>Is this really all right?</b>

06:30.540 --> 06:31.570
<b>Is what all right?</b>

06:32.210 --> 06:35.080
<b>If we’re seen like this, won’t it look a little bad?</b>

06:35.080 --> 06:37.750
<b>Do you know someone here who’d be bothered if they saw us like this, Aizawa-kun?</b>

06:37.750 --> 06:40.050
<b>I’m... fine with it, but...</b>

06:40.620 --> 06:42.980
<b>Then there’s no problem!</b>

06:56.400 --> 06:58.130
<b>Ah, there’s something new.</b>

06:59.330 --> 07:01.940
<b>So... what did you want to talk about?</b>

07:04.710 --> 07:06.570
<b>It’s about Miku...</b>

07:07.780 --> 07:09.410
<b>I was wondering if you could let up a little with her...</b>

07:12.810 --> 07:15.380
<b>You know how she’s a little strange, right?</b>

07:16.020 --> 07:18.790
<b>She can see things people normally can’t see...</b>

07:18.790 --> 07:22.290
<b>And she knows things she shouldn’t be able to know.</b>

07:22.290 --> 07:25.390
<b>Normally, rumors like that 
tend to get around.</b>

07:25.390 --> 07:29.230
<b>And if not those rumors, they say she’s
“sick,” and people back away from her.</b>

07:30.500 --> 07:32.370
<b>But...</b>

07:32.370 --> 07:37.670
<b>Yeah... Aizawa-kun, you just accept what
she’s saying plainly and simply.</b>

07:37.670 --> 07:40.940
<b>Though she scares me... just a little.</b>

07:44.380 --> 07:46.010
<b>So... why do you do that?</b>

07:46.010 --> 07:47.010
<b>I don’t know...</b>

07:48.550 --> 07:50.150
<b>It’s not something I really have a reason for...</b>

07:50.150 --> 07:53.450
<b>...or can easily put into words...</b>

07:53.460 --> 07:55.890
<b>You saw something too, didn’t you?</b>

07:56.460 --> 07:57.260
<b>Well...</b>

07:57.260 --> 07:58.730
<b>Welcome.</b>

08:00.430 --> 08:03.130
<b>Did I interrupt? Would it be better if I left?</b>

08:03.130 --> 08:04.830
<b>Ah, no, not at all.</b>

08:45.740 --> 08:47.370
<b>Taku</b>

08:47.370 --> 08:47.500
<b>Taku</b>

08:47.510 --> 08:47.640
<b>Taku</b>

08:47.640 --> 08:47.740
<b>Taku</b>

08:47.740 --> 08:47.880
<b>Taku</b>

08:47.870 --> 08:48.010
<b>Taku</b>

08:48.010 --> 08:48.140
<b>Taku</b>

08:48.140 --> 08:48.240
<b>Taku</b>

08:48.240 --> 08:48.740
<b>Taku</b>

08:48.740 --> 08:50.210
<b>Dialing</b>

08:48.740 --> 08:50.210
<b>Taku</b>

09:07.860 --> 09:09.300
<b>Hello?</b>

09:09.300 --> 09:11.000
<b>Taku?</b>

09:11.000 --> 09:13.130
<b>Yeah, sorry for suddenly hanging up like that.</b>

09:13.130 --> 09:15.140
<b>I was just about to call you back.</b>

09:15.840 --> 09:17.510
<b>Don’t worry about it.</b>

09:17.510 --> 09:18.810
<b>What happened with cram school today?</b>

09:18.810 --> 09:20.240
<b>Didn’t go today.</b>

09:20.240 --> 09:22.110
<b>Then you don’t plan on coming tomorrow, either?</b>

09:22.110 --> 09:23.980
<b>A-Ah, that’s not it!</b>

09:23.980 --> 09:27.850
<b>I was actually thinking of stopping by
that rotten convenience store later.</b>

09:30.420 --> 09:31.750
<b>Hello?</b>

09:32.890 --> 09:34.120
<b>Want to meet somewhere?</b>

09:35.320 --> 09:36.060
<b>Yeah!</b>

09:47.140 --> 09:52.310
<b>A boy of about four or five wearing
a poncho and boots?</b>

09:52.310 --> 09:54.440
<b>There’s no kid like that around here.</b>

09:54.440 --> 09:58.110
<b>Most of us here in this valley know
each other, so I’m sure of it.</b>

09:59.650 --> 10:02.220
<b>If there were someone like that here,
he’d probably be in EmeLan, but...</b>

10:02.820 --> 10:04.080
<b>The resort?</b>

10:04.090 --> 10:05.190
<b>Yeah...</b>

10:05.720 --> 10:07.190
<b>But...</b>

10:07.190 --> 10:09.190
<b>Going all the way up the Nakizawagawa River...</b>

10:09.190 --> 10:12.630
<b>...seems pretty far for a child to travel on his own...</b>

10:15.200 --> 10:19.330
<b>If it were some kid from EmeLan,
you should probably ask Unno.</b>

10:19.330 --> 10:21.170
<b>I get the feeling he’s not there...</b>

10:21.840 --> 10:25.040
<b>Not in EmeLan... 
not in the next town over...</b>

10:25.040 --> 10:27.140
<b>I get the feeling that he isn’t really anywhere...</b>

10:27.740 --> 10:29.740
<b>But you met him, didn’t you?</b>

10:31.750 --> 10:35.280
<b>Have things like this happened
to you before, Aizawa-kun?</b>

10:36.950 --> 10:40.190
<b>Umm... what I mean is...</b>

10:40.190 --> 10:43.690
<b>...have you been able to see things
that shouldn’t really be there?</b>

10:50.170 --> 10:51.830
<b>So, has she always been like that?</b>

10:51.830 --> 10:54.600
<b>You mean Miku? I’d say since about two years ago.</b>

10:54.600 --> 10:58.110
<b>When she was in second grade,
she “mysteriously disappeared.”</b>

10:58.110 --> 10:59.470
<b>That’s what the adults say...</b>

10:59.470 --> 11:01.440
<b>...or at least what people like Mikoshiba-san say.</b>

11:02.110 --> 11:05.280
<b>Though in truth, she was only lost for half a day.</b>

11:07.150 --> 11:09.420
<b>In the end, she was found over there...</b>

11:09.420 --> 11:11.290
<b>...in the Touya Forest.</b>

11:11.290 --> 11:12.750
<b>The what forest?</b>

11:12.750 --> 11:13.550
<b>The Touya Forest.</b>

11:14.190 --> 11:17.160
<b>It’s written with the character for head,
<i>tou</i>, and the first character in mansion, <i>ya</i>.</b>

11:17.160 --> 11:19.290
<b>That’s what everyone calls it.</b>

11:19.290 --> 11:21.360
<b>So... what is it?</b>

11:21.360 --> 11:24.430
<b>Apparently, this town’s lord had his
house in there a long time ago.</b>

11:24.430 --> 11:27.400
<b>So it’s called the Touya Forest and not the
Lord’s Forest or something like that?</b>

11:27.400 --> 11:29.840
<b>Huh? Now that you mention it, I guess you’re right.</b>

11:29.840 --> 11:31.210
<b>I wonder why?</b>

11:32.940 --> 11:35.010
<b>Have you ever... gone in?</b>

11:35.010 --> 11:36.780
<b>Of course not!</b>

11:36.780 --> 11:39.480
<b>I’d be cursed if I did something like that.</b>

11:40.020 --> 11:43.180
<b>Around here, even the adults try
to steer dear of that forest.</b>

11:43.190 --> 11:45.150
<b>And whenever they have to pass by it...</b>

11:45.150 --> 11:47.020
<b>...they give a humble bow and hurry on by.</b>

11:47.020 --> 11:49.320
<b>There’s lots of scary stories about the forest...</b>

11:49.320 --> 11:51.460
<b>...like the ghost of a headless warrior haunts it.</b>

11:51.460 --> 11:53.530
<b>Ghosts again, huh?</b>

11:53.530 --> 11:56.430
<b>Apparently, this valley of ours is “special.”</b>

11:56.430 --> 11:59.970
<b>And since the Touya Forest is
like the center of this valley...</b>

11:59.970 --> 12:01.900
<b>...it’s supposed to be an even more special place.</b>

12:07.610 --> 12:09.080
<b>There’s a secret...</b>

12:09.850 --> 12:12.780
<b>Some secret is hidden within the Touya Forest...</b>

12:14.880 --> 12:16.080
<b>Could be.</b>

12:17.090 --> 12:19.520
<b>I wonder what the secret is?</b>

12:19.520 --> 12:21.890
<b>Wouldn’t it be neat if that secret...</b>

12:21.890 --> 12:27.290
<b>...were a key that could unlock all the mysteries
around here, like with Wakkun and Miku?</b>

13:33.030 --> 13:35.300
<b>Oh, it’s Aizawa Ayumu.</b>

13:35.300 --> 13:36.830
<b>And Onee-chan’s with him, too.</b>

13:37.500 --> 13:38.570
<b>Are you on a date?</b>

13:38.570 --> 13:39.670
<b>No...</b>

13:39.670 --> 13:41.740
<b>We were just talking about a lot of things.</b>

13:41.740 --> 13:44.670
<b>Don’t two people normally talk
about a lot of things on a date?</b>

13:44.670 --> 13:46.010
<b>Shaddap...</b>

13:54.680 --> 13:55.480
<b>You’re such an idiot.</b>

13:55.480 --> 13:56.680
<b>Miku!</b>

13:56.690 --> 13:58.490
<b>It’s useless trying to look for him.</b>

13:58.490 --> 13:59.850
<b>You won’t find Wakkun that way.</b>

14:01.360 --> 14:03.820
<b>Wakkun’s been waiting this entire time.</b>

14:04.590 --> 14:06.130
<b>Even now, he’s still waiting.</b>

14:06.130 --> 14:08.030
<b>I’m telling you, there’s no need to look for him.</b>

14:08.030 --> 14:09.460
<b>Just hurry up and realize it already!</b>

14:13.270 --> 14:14.500
<b>Miku!</b>

14:16.440 --> 14:19.810
<b>I wonder why she’s so angry...?</b>

14:19.810 --> 14:20.740
<b>Miki.</b>

14:21.740 --> 14:22.810
<b>Hey.</b>

14:29.320 --> 14:31.190
<b>Is this Dr. Kishiro’s son?</b>

14:31.190 --> 14:32.590
<b>This is Aizawa-kun.</b>

14:32.590 --> 14:35.760
<b>And this guy’s Kaburaki Takuma-kun.
We’re classmates.</b>

14:35.760 --> 14:38.430
<b>Well, childhood friends, I guess?</b>

14:38.430 --> 14:38.930
<b>Hi...</b>

14:40.630 --> 14:41.400
<b>Hello.</b>

14:46.000 --> 14:48.500
<b>Takkun, what are you going
to do about the Cat Dance?</b>

14:48.500 --> 14:50.500
<b>I still haven’t decided.</b>

14:50.510 --> 14:52.610
<b>I might not perform in it this year.</b>

14:52.610 --> 14:54.340
<b>The Cat... Dance?</b>

14:54.340 --> 14:56.810
<b>Haven’t you seen the posters?</b>

14:56.810 --> 14:58.810
<b>Ah... yeah, I think I have.</b>

14:59.610 --> 15:00.680
<b>What about you, Miki?</b>

15:00.680 --> 15:03.720
<b>I’ll be performing in it.
Mika-nee’s even returning for it.</b>

15:03.720 --> 15:06.120
<b>The three Miyama sisters wouldn’t
miss it for anything!</b>

15:06.120 --> 15:07.560
<b>So I guess you’ll be cosplaying again?</b>

15:07.560 --> 15:09.420
<b>Don’t call it cosplaying!</b>

15:09.420 --> 15:11.030
<b>But it <i>is</i> cosplay, isn’t it?</b>

15:11.030 --> 15:12.690
<b>I’m telling you it’s different.</b>

15:12.690 --> 15:14.060
<b>So what’ll you be doing this year?</b>

15:14.060 --> 15:15.060
<b>As if I’d tell you!</b>

15:15.060 --> 15:17.130
<b>Stop by on the day of the festival and be surprised.</b>

15:17.130 --> 15:19.470
<b>I just told you I still don’t know if I’m even going to go.</b>

15:19.470 --> 15:20.600
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

15:22.370 --> 15:24.140
<b>Hey. It’s been a while.</b>

15:27.280 --> 15:29.510
<b>Ah... we just happened to meet on the way here.</b>

15:29.510 --> 15:31.610
<b>Oh? So Ayumu was with you guys, too?</b>

15:32.750 --> 15:34.110
<b>Huh? You two know each other?</b>

15:35.180 --> 15:37.150
<b>Why don’t you ask her about that thing from before?</b>

15:37.150 --> 15:37.920
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

15:38.520 --> 15:39.420
<b>What is it?</b>

15:39.420 --> 15:40.650
<b>But... it’s nothing.</b>

15:40.660 --> 15:43.160
<b>Don’t stop in the middle of what
you were saying, Ayumu.</b>

15:45.130 --> 15:48.760
<b>I just feel like what your little sister said was right...</b>

15:48.760 --> 15:49.860
<b>What are you two talking about?</b>

15:49.870 --> 15:52.630
<b>Ah, we’re just... looking for someone.</b>

15:55.140 --> 15:56.540
<b>Hey, you guys.</b>

16:00.040 --> 16:02.740
<b>Hello! Sukawara Akira here!</b>

16:02.740 --> 16:05.210
<b>I wonder if you’d let me listen in for a bit?</b>

16:07.450 --> 16:10.120
<b>Sorry... I have to go somewhere...</b>

16:10.120 --> 16:10.890
<b>Thanks for today.</b>

16:11.950 --> 16:13.090
<b>I’ll message you later.</b>

16:13.920 --> 16:15.620
<b>I also...</b>

16:15.620 --> 16:18.830
<b>...have to help out with my family’s store,
so I should probably get going...</b>

16:18.830 --> 16:19.530
<b>Bye!</b>

16:19.530 --> 16:20.490
<b>Oh, my...</b>

16:25.230 --> 16:26.770
<b>Well, you guys...</b>

16:26.770 --> 16:29.370
<b>I don’t like the media very much, so...</b>

16:29.370 --> 16:30.340
<b>I’ll call you later.</b>

16:30.340 --> 16:31.570
<b>Wait... Taku!</b>

16:33.140 --> 16:34.140
<b>What?!</b>

16:34.140 --> 16:37.110
<b>Indeed. <i>That</i> is the important question here.</b>

16:38.510 --> 16:40.780
<b>Hey, will you please cooperate with me for a bit?</b>

16:42.350 --> 16:45.050
<b>If it’s just news material,
you filmed me the other day, didn’t you?</b>

16:45.050 --> 16:46.990
<b>I’d like to have a more serious,
sophisticated talk with you.</b>

16:46.990 --> 16:48.560
<b>I’ll find some way to thank you, so...</b>

16:50.490 --> 16:52.790
<b>For now, why don’t we have a seat in that gazebo?</b>

16:52.790 --> 16:54.230
<b>What do you want to talk about?</b>

16:54.760 --> 16:59.000
<b>First... let’s start with Aizawa Ayumu and
your happy little friends, I suppose.</b>

17:26.460 --> 17:27.500
<b>Roku.</b>

17:30.230 --> 17:31.830
<b>Nothing’s there.</b>

17:35.270 --> 17:39.470
<b>As this world’s membrane grows thinner,
many things begin to occur, indeed...</b>

17:42.940 --> 17:46.410
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

17:44.310 --> 17:45.350
<b>Take care.</b>

17:46.410 --> 17:53.790
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

17:49.380 --> 17:52.190
<b>Hello? This is the Kishiro Animal Hospital.</b>

17:52.190 --> 17:53.790
<b>Oh, it’s you, Ayumu?</b>

17:53.790 --> 17:55.460
<b>Umm...</b>

17:55.460 --> 18:00.330
<b>I’m sorry, but it doesn’t look like I’ll
be able to prepare dinner tonight...</b>

18:00.330 --> 18:02.760
<b>That’s fine, but what are you doing?</b>

18:06.230 --> 18:08.340
<b>I feel kind of strange...</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.800
<b>...and I’m not too sure about it myself, but...</b>

18:10.810 --> 18:12.710
<b>...there’s something I want to confirm.</b>

18:12.710 --> 18:13.740
<b>Are you in trouble?</b>

18:13.740 --> 18:15.740
<b>No, it’s nothing like that.</b>

18:15.740 --> 18:16.980
<b>I see.</b>

18:16.980 --> 18:19.710
<b>In that case, feel free to talk to
me about it when you’re ready.</b>

18:20.280 --> 18:21.720
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:21.720 --> 18:22.820
<b>Bye.</b>

18:29.930 --> 18:32.330
<b>“He’s been waiting this entire time”?</b>

18:32.330 --> 18:34.660
<b>Aren’t I the one who’s been waiting to see him again?</b>

18:38.700 --> 18:41.040
<b>My, how unusual. Where’s your son?</b>

18:41.040 --> 18:42.600
<b>Seems like he’s busy with something tonight.</b>

18:43.410 --> 18:46.240
<b>Apparently this summer is supposed
to be pretty difficult.</b>

18:46.240 --> 18:48.880
<b>This summer isn’t the only thing that’s difficult.</b>

18:48.880 --> 18:50.910
<b>It’s supposed to be “special” or something.</b>

18:50.910 --> 18:53.180
<b>At least, that’s what Mikoshiba-san said.</b>

18:53.180 --> 18:56.620
<b>With all the strange weather we’ve
been having these past few days...</b>

18:56.620 --> 18:58.350
<b>...it’s hard to tell what’s “special” anymore.</b>

18:58.350 --> 19:01.360
<b>No... Mikoshiba-san said that a lot
of things are going to happen.</b>

19:01.360 --> 19:02.290
<b>Like what?</b>

19:02.290 --> 19:04.090
<b>I don’t know.</b>

19:04.090 --> 19:07.430
<b>That person never tells me anything specific.</b>

19:08.700 --> 19:10.400
<b>I’ve thought about that mysteriousness
for a while now...</b>

19:11.330 --> 19:13.300
<b>...but just what kind of person is Mikoshiba-san?</b>

19:13.300 --> 19:15.740
<b>Just one of those people 
who lives day by day.</b>

19:15.740 --> 19:17.370
<b>Shall I warm up your dinner?</b>

19:17.370 --> 19:19.310
<b>Ah... no thanks.</b>

19:19.310 --> 19:21.210
<b>I’ve got a microwave at my place.</b>

19:53.780 --> 19:55.410
<b>You want me to follow you?</b>

20:13.300 --> 20:15.430
<b>So, what now?</b>

20:20.540 --> 20:21.840
<b>What is it?</b>

21:05.650 --> 21:06.780
<b>Wakkun.</b>

21:10.050 --> 21:11.350
<b>Amu! You came!</b>

21:14.020 --> 21:14.990
<b>Be careful!</b>

21:19.590 --> 21:21.200
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:21.200 --> 21:22.530
<b>Let’s play!</b>

21:22.530 --> 21:23.930
<b>But it’s already dark out.</b>

21:23.930 --> 21:25.400
<b>No it’s not!</b>

21:25.400 --> 21:26.870
<b>And we promised, too!</b>

21:27.770 --> 21:30.700
<b>Our promise! You said you’d play with me again.</b>

21:32.870 --> 21:34.380
<b>Hey... just who are you?</b>

21:35.080 --> 21:36.640
<b>Wakkun.</b>

21:36.650 --> 21:38.010
<b>Amu.</b>

21:38.010 --> 21:39.250
<b>Let’s play!</b>

21:39.250 --> 21:40.850
<b>It’s already late today...</b>

21:40.850 --> 21:44.150
<b>Then tomorrow?
Can we play tomorrow?</b>

21:50.660 --> 21:51.290
<b>Okay.</b>

21:53.530 --> 21:54.530
<b>Promise.</b>

21:55.800 --> 21:56.500
<b>Pinky swear.</b>

21:58.300 --> 21:59.700
<b>Pinky swear!</b>

22:02.300 --> 22:04.640
<b>I’ll call Dosshiru and Shisshin to play, too!</b>

22:04.640 --> 22:05.940
<b>Who?</b>

22:06.610 --> 22:08.580
<b>You already forgot about them?</b>

22:14.620 --> 22:15.680
<b>Dosshiru...?</b>

22:16.650 --> 22:17.890
<b>Yeah.</b>

22:17.890 --> 22:20.390
<b>See you tomorrow. Tomorrow, okay?</b>

22:20.390 --> 22:22.020
<b>Let’s play lots then, okay?</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.980 --> 24:21.580
<b>Hey, all of you out there.</b>

24:19.980 --> 24:22.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:21.580 --> 24:24.110
<b>You’re probably wondering a
lot about my hat now, huh?</b>

24:24.110 --> 24:24.750
<b>What?</b>

24:24.750 --> 24:27.080
<b>Wondering why I’m always wearing it?</b>

24:27.080 --> 24:29.120
<b>Wondering if someone gave it to me as a present?</b>

24:29.120 --> 24:30.780
<b>I haven’t really wondered about it.</b>

24:30.790 --> 24:31.620
<b>Who cares, anyway?</b>

24:31.620 --> 24:33.620
<b>No, you definitely must be wondering about it.</b>

24:33.620 --> 24:35.560
<b>There are a ton of things I really
want to tell you guys.</b>

24:35.560 --> 24:39.560
<b>But if I were to tell you about it, it would
be a big spoiler of Zettai Shonen!</b>

24:39.560 --> 24:41.330
<b>Eh? No way! Really?!</b>

24:41.330 --> 24:44.030
<b>You can expect a lot of <i>amazing</i> episodes about it!</b>

24:44.030 --> 24:45.470
<b>If it’s that important, 
why don’t you tell us about it?</b>

24:45.470 --> 24:46.830
<b>Tell you about what?</b>

24:46.840 --> 24:49.100
<b>You know, spoil those episodes for us!</b>

24:49.100 --> 24:51.730
<b>A man won’t reveal his past that easily!</b>

24:51.730 --> 24:54.200
<b>I guess you could just call it a man’s rhythm.</b>

24:54.200 --> 24:55.780
<b>Putting that aside, next time is:</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>The Heaviness of a Promise and
the Lightness of a Dream</b>

24:55.780 --> 24:58.050
<b>“The Heaviness of a Promise and
the Lightness of a Dream.”</b>
